Chapter: ProseBinaryControl

Section: Definitions

  ordinary : Integer -> Integer
  ordinary (n) =
   n + 1

   + 1000

 Prose before a valid column-3 definition.
  extra : Integer = 1000

  unchanged : Integer -> Integer
  unchanged (n) =
   n + 1

 Prose before a column-3 token outside the preceding body.
  + 1000

Section: Entry

  opening : Integer = ordinary 1 + extra + unchanged 1
